<p class="lede">Things you can do with your membership card.</p>

<h2>Actions</h2>
<div class="action-list">
  <button id="card-renew" type="button" aria-label="Extend the loan period on every item">Renew</button>
  <button id="card-pay" type="button" aria-label="Settle outstanding charges">Pay</button>
  <button id="card-report" type="button" aria-label="Tell us your card is lost">Report</button>
  <button id="card-freeze" type="button" aria-label="Suspend borrowing temporarily">Freeze</button>
  <button id="card-replace" type="button" aria-label="Order a new membership card">Replace</button>
  <button id="card-upgrade" type="button" aria-label="Move to a family membership">Upgrade</button>
  <button id="card-close" type="button" aria-label="End your membership">Close</button>
</div>

<p class="muted">Changes to your membership take effect the next working day. Staff at any branch
  can help if you would rather do this in person.</p>
